# Context ledger — {{CYCLE_SLUG}}

Per-cycle telemetry recording context-heavy events (large reads, delegations, sub-agent invocations). Phase 6.4 of the context-optimization plan. Used to detect regressions: if a stage starts reading code in main when its main-read budget says it shouldn't, that row appears here as a `large` class read with `location: main` in an unexpected stage.

> _Coarse, not exact. The goal is regression detection, not exact token accounting. Use `scripts/ledger.sh append` to record events; do not hand-edit the table below._

